{"assets":[],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"1758","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"B. XOR = Average"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"1 second"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"256 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"You are given an integer $$$n$$$. Find a sequence of $$$n$$$ integers $$$a_1, a_2, \\dots, a_n$$$ such that $$$1 \\leq a_i \\leq 10^9$$$ for all $$$i$$$ and $$$$$$a_1 \\oplus a_2 \\oplus \\dots \\oplus a_n = \\frac{a_1 + a_2 + \\dots + a_n}{n},$$$$$$ where $$$\\oplus$$$ represents the "},{"attrs":{"href":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bitwise_operation#XOR"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"bitwise XOR"}],"kind":"link"},{"kind":"text","text":"."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"It can be proven that there exists a sequence of integers that satisfies all the conditions above."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line of input contains $$$t$$$ ($$$1 \\leq t \\leq 10^4$$$) — the number of test cases."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first and only line of each test case contains one integer $$$n$$$ ($$$1 \\leq n \\leq 10^5$$$) — the length of the sequence you have to find."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The sum of $$$n$$$ over all test cases does not exceed $$$10^5$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"For each test case, output $$$n$$$ space-separated integers $$$a_1, a_2, \\dots, a_n$$$ satisfying the conditions in the statement. "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"If there are several possible answers, you can output any of them."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Example"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n3\n1\n4\n3\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n69\n13 2 8 1\n7 7 7\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"note"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Note"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the first test case, $$$69 = \\frac{69}{1} = 69$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the second test case, $$$13 \\oplus 2 \\oplus 8 \\oplus 1 = \\frac{13 + 2 + 8 + 1}{4} = 6$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"document"},"index":"B","problemCode":"1758B","schema":2,"sourceKind":"html","sourceUrl":"https://codeforces.com/contest/1758/problem/B"}